VISUAL: Claymation character flying with a sword.
AUDIO: 'Now you can create amazing claymation videos using AI. This style of stop-motion used to require months to achieve just 60 seconds of footage. But now, entire movies can be made in minutes with nothing more than a'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'laptop computer. I\'m Jack. I have spent more than a decade creating visual effects for many of the biggest brands on the planet. And now I\'m using AI to reinvent the creative workflow . Claymation has a'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'real charm. It feels quirky, tactile, and unique, making it perfect for short films, client ads, and even music videos. Today I\'ll teach you every step of the process , including all the tricks and tips'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that other creators aren\'t telling you. So, as soon as you finish this video, you\'ll be able to start creating your own project from scratch. It\'s not just about saving time and money, it\'s about having total creative control'

[00:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and acquiring the knowledge to become a writer, director, and animator, all in one. If you enjoyed today\'s content, be sure to give it a "like" and consider subscribing. Okay , let\'s get started. First of all,'

